  "historyNote": "#6469-B, eff 3-5-97 (from Env-A 406); ss and moved by #8233, eff 12-22-04 (from Env-A 405.02); ss by #10288, eff 3-19-13 (from Env-A 405.02); ss by #13641, eff 5-23-23",
